<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="28152387"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1537788139"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Before my body is dry"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="小林未郁 / David Whitaker"/><amll:meta key="album" value="「キルラキル」オリジナルサウンドトラック"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:08.267"><div begin="00:17.416" end="03:47.133"><p begin="00:17.416" end="00:21.874" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">In the dusty basement where we met<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们相遇在废弃已久的地下室里</span></p><p begin="00:23.321" end="00:27.203" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">May, you surprised me so much<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也许 你为我的到来震惊不已</span></p><p begin="00:27.421" end="00:31.708" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Because you're talking now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你在和我对话</span></p><p begin="00:32.765" end="00:37.921" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">I gotta find the truth from many fights<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在数不清的战斗里寻觅真相</span></p><p begin="00:37.931" end="00:39.557" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">But I'm all alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我孤身一人</span></p><p begin="00:39.567" end="00:43.581" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">You're the only one who can help me out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有你 能够帮我逃离困境</span></p><p begin="00:43.734" end="00:46.129" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">We'll be as one<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们团结一致</span></p><p begin="00:47.896" end="00:49.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">We're ready to fight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们准备好加入战斗</span></p><p begin="00:49.916" end="00:51.773" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Look over there<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看看那边</span></p><p begin="00:51.945" end="00:55.738" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">They try to kill us for stars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了得到星服 他们企图杀人灭口</span></p><p begin="00:55.844" end="01:02.565" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Our bond has got much stronger than before<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们之间的羁绊比以往变得更强大</span></p><p begin="01:02.885" end="01:07.176" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Don't lose your way in your mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别迷失方向</span></p><p begin="01:07.186" end="01:10.846" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">We have to be as one<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们必须团结一致</span></p><p begin="01:10.856" end="01:15.136" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Don't be afraid, my sweet heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的 别害怕</span></p><p begin="01:15.177" end="01:19.303" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">This is the way to be more strong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是变得强大的必由之路</span></p><p begin="01:19.313" end="01:23.104" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Harbor my deep secret<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心底藏着秘密</span></p><p begin="01:23.164" end="01:27.092" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">It makes me so blue<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我郁郁寡欢</span></p><p begin="01:27.102" end="01:37.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Run through this game before my body is dry<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">趁着我依然热血沸腾 把这场游戏进行到底</span></p><p begin="01:52.050" end="01:54.606" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">So, it seems there's no other choice but to go all out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看来已经别无选择</span></p><p begin="01:54.767" end="01:56.443" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Stay with me and let's stand out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能全力以赴</span></p><p begin="01:56.640" end="01:59.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">And outshine those tryna get our stars now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些企图得到我们的星服的人 必会相形见绌</span></p><p begin="01:59.406" end="02:02.351" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">All we have to do is figure out how strong we are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们所要做的就是搞清楚自己究竟有多强大</span></p><p begin="02:02.361" end="02:04.079" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">And what it takes to stay alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">隐瞒真相究竟要付出多少代价</span></p><p begin="02:04.335" end="02:06.895" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Sync and learn what we can do to take 'em down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">互相配合 学会如何打败他们</span></p><p begin="02:07.124" end="02:08.812" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">It's revenge and survive for now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是复仇 也是求生技能</span></p><p begin="02:09.122" end="02:11.997" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">We know in part and you can feel my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们解开了一部分迷局</span></p><p begin="02:12.007" end="02:16.069" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">So, help me to stay focused so I don't fall apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">帮我集中注意力 我就不会濒临崩溃</span></p><p begin="02:16.152" end="02:20.014" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">I wanna be complete, it's not in me to retreat<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要变完美</span></p><p begin="02:20.077" end="02:24.275" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">I could lose on my own, so I really need you with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">单亲匹马 我会失败 我需要你与我并肩战斗</span></p><p begin="02:24.708" end="02:28.407" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">I gotta find out who killed my dad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将查出谁是杀害我爸爸的凶手</span></p><p begin="02:28.613" end="02:32.369" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I hear the v of you in my mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在心里听到你的声音</span></p><p begin="02:32.575" end="02:36.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">I gotta find out who killed my dad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将查出谁是杀害我爸爸的凶手</span></p><p begin="02:36.667" end="02:42.588" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">I hear the v of you in my mind, so<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在心里听到你的声音</span></p><p begin="02:43.199" end="02:44.425" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">My blood is pumping<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我热血沸腾</span></p><p begin="02:44.796" end="02:46.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">I'm ready to fight when you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你下定决心 我也准备好浴血奋战</span></p><p begin="02:47.019" end="02:50.726" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Let's let no one break the bond that is ours<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们之间的纽带坚不可摧</span></p><p begin="02:50.964" end="02:53.785" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Show them what it means to be a shining star<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让他们知道成为万众瞩目的焦点有何意义</span></p><p begin="02:54.102" end="02:57.466" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">You have my body, let's fight as one<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我融为一体</span></p><p begin="02:56.853" end="03:01.099" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Can't move my feet in the dark<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在黑暗中 我举步维艰</span></p><p begin="03:01.242" end="03:04.849" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Don't wanna be all alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不愿孤苦无依</span></p><p begin="03:04.995" end="03:09.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Can't feel the heat in my blood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法感受血液里的热度</span></p><p begin="03:09.380" end="03:12.825" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Do you remember what he said?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否记得他说过的话</span></p><p begin="03:12.835" end="03:17.072" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Don't lose your way in your mind (I really need you with me)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别迷失方向</span></p><p begin="03:17.264" end="03:20.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">We have to be as one (Help me to stay focused)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我需要你与我并肩战斗</span></p><p begin="03:20.950" end="03:25.273" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Don't be afraid, my sweet heart (I wanna be complete)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的 别害怕</span></p><p begin="03:25.383" end="03:29.295" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">This is the way to be more strong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是变得强大的必由之路</span></p><p begin="03:29.305" end="03:33.021" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">Harbor my deep secret (Fight as one with me)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心底藏着秘密</span></p><p begin="03:33.031" end="03:36.817" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">It makes me so blue (Let's take 'em down)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我郁郁寡欢</span></p><p begin="03:37.141" end="03:47.133" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">Run through this game before my body is dry (Be a shining star)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成为万众瞩目的焦点</span></p><p begin="03:43.363" end="03:46.849" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">(You have my body, I'm ready to fight when you are)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我融为一体</span></p></div></body></tt>